"recommendationid": "155424175", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373623939", "personaname": "Blue_Pixel_Ninja", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373623939/", "num_games_owned": 160, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 2420, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1713, "last_played": 1707170578, "avatar": "34bd865f71ebd1f7891922170a9066768acad7ef"}, "language": "english", "review": "While not as good as the original trilogy there's still a lot to like about this game. Id say if you enjoyed the originals then get this game but don't go in with too high expectations.\nThat being said I think that the exploration is the best in the series and the combat is also incredibly smooth. The third pillar of mass effect story and dialog is where this game falters. Its not awful and there are some legitimately great high points but its definitely not to the quality of the other mass effect games.", "timestamp_created": 1704576837, "timestamp_updated": 1704576837, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "155414413", "author": {"steamid": "76561198875092084", "personaname": "Uracán", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Uracan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 149, "playtime_forever": 181172, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 56338, "last_played": 1787687721, "avatar": "dbc3331ba193af054badca72f06234d2c43f9c68"}, "language": "english", "review": "I can't really understand the hate this game gets... OK ok the story is different from the previous game and it wasn't that bad honestly... even if I can't say if I prefer this instead of the old games.\nWas a great one tho", "timestamp_created